The `pkgreg` server binary statically links the modules listed below. The list is
derived from the linked module set reported by `go version -m bin/pkgreg`, not
from `go.mod`, so it names what is actually distributed rather than what is
merely required for development or testing.

`pkgreg-client` and `pkgreg-bridge` link no third-party modules at all — they are
standard-library only.

